WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.770
The aftermath is not always easier.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.505
These are the firemen

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.341
of the most bombed city on earth Orikhiv,

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.579
in the throes of the counteroffensive.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:14.647
And this is a normal day for them.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:18.485
The rest of the year must year for peace

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:21.888
across the year provides

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.123
journalism.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.691
Here's the story of one

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.026
we've gotten to know.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:36.469
Dima.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:47.147
Pain here

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.482
doesn't just come from the flames

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.151
away from the front lines.

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.886
Ukraine is suffering in ways

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.087
we don't see.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.822
Dima has lost

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:56.923
nearly all his family

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.258
since the war began.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.492
His wife left for europe

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.527
as a refugee

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:01.294
just days

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.663
after the war started with his son.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:04.431
And he doesn't know

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.366
if they will ever come back.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.568
The emptiness of their family home

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.104
is a crippling, constant weight on him.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:36.229
The gaps between the horror.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.798
Harder than the horror itself.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.468
And sleep when it comes is sometimes

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.235
worse.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:41.060
Orikhiv

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.061
has been ground

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.731
to dust in the last two months

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.064
but Dima's

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.333
grief here came immediately

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.202
with last year's invasion.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:51.871
His father died in its first days

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:53.973
just before his wife left

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.575
from a heart attack

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:58.444
he says because of shelling

00:02:58.444 --> 00:02:59.746
in that chaos.

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.981
Dima had to bury his father himself.

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:18.031
He only has his mother left.

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:19.232
She won't leave the house

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:20.533
where his father died

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:22.068
and where Dima was born

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.704
and where the flames may strike again.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:49.229
Nearly

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:51.431
every Ukrainian home has holes in it

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:53.533
from people who won't come back.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:56.269
And emotions forged in a war with no end

00:03:56.269 --> 00:03:57.537
in sight.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.769
That dream of Dima's

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:32.272
the time where now in his sleep

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:33.873
he sees his family again

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:35.408
particularly haunting in a sign, frankly,

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:36.476
the trauma is going through

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:38.077
so many Ukrainian homes right

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.812
now, away from the headlines,

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.414
away from the violence

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.883
and the public seen front lines

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.085
Ukraine got some good news today

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:47.120
and over the weekend,

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.523
its long held pleas for F16s American

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:51.524
supplied jets

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:53.760
to protect the skies around towns

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.928
and potentially assist on the front line

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:57.363
God a step further forwards

00:04:57.363 --> 00:04:59.732
Denmark saying they'd send 19 slow

00:04:59.999 --> 00:05:00.767
the Netherlands saying

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:03.136
they might send the best part of 42

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:04.804
president Zelensky

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:06.472
and his tour round European country

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:07.607
saying in Greece today

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:08.608
that Greece have agreed

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:10.410
to help train pilots.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.711
We don't know the details there

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:13.313
none of this fast enough though

00:05:13.313 --> 00:05:15.214
it won't arrive until next year

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:16.482
and in the next four months

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:17.550
and the summer here

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.886
Ukrainians will continue to suffer Wolf.

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:21.354
Nick Paton Walsh reporting for us.

00:05:21.354 --> 00:05:22.689
Nick, thank you very much.

